cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use paper-trends in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "paper-trends: publication-trend analysis for any academic conference"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hu
    given-names: Minjia
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Minjia-Hu/paper-trends"
abstract: >-
  Fetches a conference's paper metadata from OpenAlex and reports keyword trends,
  topic evolution, and institution, author and country rankings, as a CLI,
  static report pages and a Streamlit app.
keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - scientometrics
  - OpenAlex
  - conference proceedings
  - research trends
